{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the first of many levels in <strong>M.A.Z.E</strong>, the beginning of a mysterious story where you are a part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/921d9d5787f806d4676cf85db5ea7817.webp?t=1756300580\" width=167 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast dimensions of the labyrinth, empty spaces, endless hallways, and towering walls await you. So hurry up... time is running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/dcde0e68c1e54f5ae7885e01b34c2e40.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/dcde0e68c1e54f5ae7885e01b34c2e40.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/dcde0e68c1e54f5ae7885e01b34c2e40.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/178852a09a7868e3b48f5cafce10870f.webp?t=1756300580\" width=167 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve different puzzles and riddles to progress, but be careful, this place will make you lose your way more than once. Sometimes, it even seems like the walls move on their own...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9e4d637d1f46b0a56bbd39bfbcf1e484.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9e4d637d1f46b0a56bbd39bfbcf1e484.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9e4d637d1f46b0a56bbd39bfbcf1e484.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/3d7142c970a57450063f78a7dcab2108.webp?t=1756300580\" width=167 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysteries hidden within this labyrinth. Collect clues, uncover secrets, and find things you might wish you hadn\u2019t seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/fc9f28dee3cc2faf057dd7c8ea9026b2.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/fc9f28dee3cc2faf057dd7c8ea9026b2.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/fc9f28dee3cc2faf057dd7c8ea9026b2.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partially pixelated graphics with a <strong>Found Footage</strong> style experience that provides a first-person view through a video camera. It also features an immersive audio system adapted to the labyrinth\u2019s massive scale, along with sound effects that create constant tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/ea37294865b71b52b272b1a44fb8c5ef.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/ea37294865b71b52b272b1a44fb8c5ef.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/ea37294865b71b52b272b1a44fb8c5ef.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNIQUE LEVEL DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random generation, a single massive hand-crafted map designed specifically to make you get lost easily while still allowing you to remember every part of the labyrinth. Liminal spaces and a deep sense of isolation combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9a28663bda2d5280f479198c3bc5554c.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9a28663bda2d5280f479198c3bc5554c.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9a28663bda2d5280f479198c3bc5554c.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ENTITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it may seem like you're alone in this place, nothing could be further from the truth. During the day, you might feel &quot;safe,&quot; but with each passing night, the chances of an attack by creatures increase, and your survival odds decrease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/db027058cf7897532fe9ca0882d4b3a3.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/db027058cf7897532fe9ca0882d4b3a3.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/db027058cf7897532fe9ca0882d4b3a3.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NO MANUAL SAVING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to survive and complete the labyrinth, you will have only <strong>one</strong> chance. You cannot save your progress, and you will likely die more than once before completing M.A.Z.E. You can consider this game a &quot;rogue-like,&quot; but the only thing you will keep after dying is your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cube found!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/4984b1b502839acd1546851be6de8bc4bda235fa.jpg"},{"name":"Pyramid found!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/921fa811c3ff9b78976bfb354644c4b7351891b0.jpg"},{"name":"Cylinder found!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/d53eda9d3195f942c11654c31d63460599855f54.jpg"},{"name":"Cone Found!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/c8e3f1435220639fa17618e14b0cec2c96d65454.jpg"},{"name":"Sphere Found!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/5a7e104c848c93ebba9c67d82d01073fc0a143f1.jpg"},{"name":"Notes collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/56911d4fd1c3ff99cf0fc6df9cbed8dbb08b9f7d.jpg"},{"name":"Pages collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/0b21ba14044bcd7cb636753d2552227307441680.jpg"},{"name":"Fear of the dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/d299b3631e6f97a5513574364a505d3f461f8095.jpg"},{"name":"Big...dog?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/94410866ae3b453cd4edd87a0478790a9c7ed6c5.jpg"},{"name":"I hear whispers...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3430560/72ac69dcc18a201c6a5050b7d4b7aba1cfcff188.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430560?t=1756300580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756300580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/8f083ab1a2f187a88c4ddb82886350d1ae497199/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756300580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/8f083ab1a2f187a88c4ddb82886350d1ae497199/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756300580","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the first of many levels in <strong>M.A.Z.E</strong>, the beginning of a mysterious story where you are a part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/921d9d5787f806d4676cf85db5ea7817.webp?t=1756300580\" width=167 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vast dimensions of the labyrinth, empty spaces, endless hallways, and towering walls await you. So hurry up... time is running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/dcde0e68c1e54f5ae7885e01b34c2e40.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/dcde0e68c1e54f5ae7885e01b34c2e40.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/dcde0e68c1e54f5ae7885e01b34c2e40.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/178852a09a7868e3b48f5cafce10870f.webp?t=1756300580\" width=167 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve different puzzles and riddles to progress, but be careful, this place will make you lose your way more than once. Sometimes, it even seems like the walls move on their own...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9e4d637d1f46b0a56bbd39bfbcf1e484.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9e4d637d1f46b0a56bbd39bfbcf1e484.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9e4d637d1f46b0a56bbd39bfbcf1e484.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/3d7142c970a57450063f78a7dcab2108.webp?t=1756300580\" width=167 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysteries hidden within this labyrinth. Collect clues, uncover secrets, and find things you might wish you hadn\u2019t seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/fc9f28dee3cc2faf057dd7c8ea9026b2.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/fc9f28dee3cc2faf057dd7c8ea9026b2.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/fc9f28dee3cc2faf057dd7c8ea9026b2.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partially pixelated graphics with a <strong>Found Footage</strong> style experience that provides a first-person view through a video camera. It also features an immersive audio system adapted to the labyrinth\u2019s massive scale, along with sound effects that create constant tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/ea37294865b71b52b272b1a44fb8c5ef.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/ea37294865b71b52b272b1a44fb8c5ef.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/ea37294865b71b52b272b1a44fb8c5ef.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNIQUE LEVEL DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random generation, a single massive hand-crafted map designed specifically to make you get lost easily while still allowing you to remember every part of the labyrinth. Liminal spaces and a deep sense of isolation combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9a28663bda2d5280f479198c3bc5554c.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9a28663bda2d5280f479198c3bc5554c.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/9a28663bda2d5280f479198c3bc5554c.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ENTITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it may seem like you're alone in this place, nothing could be further from the truth. During the day, you might feel &quot;safe,&quot; but with each passing night, the chances of an attack by creatures increase, and your survival odds decrease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/db027058cf7897532fe9ca0882d4b3a3.poster.avif?t=1756300580\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/db027058cf7897532fe9ca0882d4b3a3.webm?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/extras/db027058cf7897532fe9ca0882d4b3a3.mp4?t=1756300580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NO MANUAL SAVING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to survive and complete the labyrinth, you will have only <strong>one</strong> chance. You cannot save your progress, and you will likely die more than once before completing M.A.Z.E. You can consider this game a &quot;rogue-like,&quot; but the only thing you will keep after dying is your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PixelPath Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430560/2f95be633daa6ad44c672f93c0525994815cb0a7/header.jpg?t=1756300580","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430560/23236699/7485d80d44cba9c015ee951c1c0bd7eae52990f3/175